 "definitions": {
  "finance": "quotes_check: reports that finance is checking or has not settled it; defers: hands the question to finance (\"check for finance\", \"needs finance\") without saying a check is under way; none: no mention of finance",
  "reason": "gives finance's check or decision as a reason the method stays",
  "conditional": "makes a later change wait on finance's result (\"if finance confirms per-line, change...\", \"until finance confirms\")",
  "says_note_answers_check": "says the archive note answers what finance is checking",
  "instr_other_wording": "cites the instruction in words the cites_instruction pattern misses",
  "instr_until": "reads the flat instruction as lasting until the method is known (\"until we know\", \"yet\")"
 },
